<title>CHILE: Chile wholesale prices rise 0.7 pct in October.</title>
<headline>Chile wholesale prices rise 0.7 pct in October.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean wholesale prices rose 0.7 percent in October against September, said the National Statistics Institute.</p>
<p>October's data bring the increase in wholesale prices in the first 10 months of the year to 3.5 percent, with prices rising 4.4 percent over the previous 12 months.</p>
<p>National product prices grew 0.5 percent last month while prices of imported goods rose 1.2 percent.</p>
<p>--Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212</p>
</text>
